WEBVTT

00:06:59.707 --> 00:07:01.459
What will this world look like?

00:07:02.334 --> 00:07:08.215
This world may see machines and humans
generating new intimacies

00:07:08.257 --> 00:07:10.050
and alternate perspectives.

00:07:11.469 --> 00:07:15.306
My hope is that these aerobes
will help us appreciate

00:07:15.306 --> 00:07:18.225
a more diverse way of living and being.

00:07:20.019 --> 00:07:24.773
Their purpose is not
to compete with us or to dominate us,

00:07:24.773 --> 00:07:28.777
but to ask what a more compatible
future could look like.